msgid "OxiDNS Plus - TTL-adaptive Prewarming"
msgstr "OxiDNS Plus - TTL 自适应预热"

msgid "Keeps your important domains warm by watching each cached TTL. Just after a fresh entry expires, a single query is sent to OxiDNS so its native lazy cache refreshes in the background. No cache is deleted, no upstream is queried by this add-on, and TTL changes are followed automatically."
msgstr "通过监视每个缓存 TTL 让重要域名保持温热。当一条缓存刚过期时，本插件会向 OxiDNS 发送一次查询，由其原生惰性缓存在后台完成刷新。不删除任何缓存、不自行查询上游，并能自动跟随 TTL 变化。"

